PTX tma-store-epilogue
"TMA store epilogue: each thread writes its part of the tile to shared memory, fence.proxy.async.shared::cta, then a named barrier; one thread issues the bulk store and commits the group (CUTLASS sm90_epilogue_tma_warpspecialized.hpp:734-749, copy_sm90_tma.hpp:1214-1228). The store must copy the thread's value, not the initial 0. Expected: forbidden."
{
s=0 @cta 0;
g=9;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0      | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         ;
 st.weak.shared::cta s, 1      | bar.sync 1, 2                                    ;
 fence.proxy.async.shared::cta | cp.async.bulk.global.shared::cta.bulk_group g, s ;
 bar.sync 1, 2                 | cp.async.bulk.commit_group                       ;
                               | cp.async.bulk.wait_group.read 0                  ;
exists
(g == 0)
